          %p
            Due to the
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/unitary+group#SUn"} relation to the special unitary group
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi U
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
